sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as Spring Boot (Orchestration)
    participant PE as Python Probing Engine
    participant R as Redis Streams
    participant LG as LangGraph Agents
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>UI: Click "Run Diagnosis" (select target)
    UI->>API: POST /diagnosis (target)
    API->>DB: Create job (status = queued)
    API-->>UI: 202 Accepted + job_id
    UI->>API: Open WebSocket (STOMP) subscribe /jobs/{id}

    API->>PE: Dispatch probe request (job_id, target)
    API->>DB: Update job status = running
    API-->>UI: WS push: status = running

    PE->>PE: Run ping, DNS, port, log/service checks
    PE->>R: Publish probe-result events (stream)

    R->>LG: Consumer group signals evidence ready
    LG->>LG: Network Agent evaluates evidence
    LG->>LG: Database Agent evaluates evidence
    LG->>LG: Infrastructure Agent evaluates evidence
    LG->>LG: Coordinator merges findings into root cause, confidence, suggested fix

    LG->>DB: Persist agent reasoning + incident summary
    LG->>API: Notify result ready (job_id, verdict)

    alt Suggested action is destructive
        API->>DB: Create approval_request (status = pending)
        API-->>UI: WS push: awaiting_approval + evidence + suggested action
        U->>UI: Approve / Reject
        UI->>API: POST /approval/{id}/decision
        API->>DB: Update approval_request + remediation_log
        API-->>UI: WS push: status = complete (decision recorded)
    else Suggested action is safe / informational
        API->>DB: Update job status = complete
        API-->>UI: WS push: status = complete + full report
    end

    UI-->>U: Render evidence, root cause, confidence, suggested fix
